1
00:00:00,344 --> 00:00:02,544
W-We didn't vote!

2
00:00:02,546 --> 00:00:04,676
(Leonard:)We didn't have to--
that was clearly a tangent.

3
00:00:04,681 --> 00:00:06,351
(Leonard:)Now come on.
Back to work.

4
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:08,180
(Leonard:)If we're leaning towards
quantum coupling...

5
00:00:08,185 --> 00:00:10,455
(Leonard:)Aah! Why?

6
00:00:10,454 --> 00:00:12,124
(Sheldon:)You said
"quantum coupling."

7
00:00:12,122 --> 00:00:14,322
(Sheldon:)That made me think
of the show Quantum Leap.

8
00:00:14,324 --> 00:00:17,324
(Sheldon:)That's a tangent
and it's your fault.

9
00:00:17,327 --> 00:00:19,927
(Howard:)That's ridiculous.
Sheldon, I vote that
is not a tangent.

10
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:21,460
(Leonard:)Thank you.
And now I owe you one.

11
00:00:21,465 --> 00:00:23,535
Ow!

12
00:00:23,533 --> 00:00:25,333
(Sheldon:)That was your fault.

13
00:00:25,335 --> 00:00:26,865
Hey!

14
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:28,970
(Raj:)Ooh, that is a lot of hair.

15
00:00:29,773 --> 00:00:31,443
Ow!

16
00:00:31,441 --> 00:00:34,841
(Raj:)And now I'm gonna hear it
from Jenny.

17
00:00:34,845 --> 00:00:36,775
(stammers)
Everyone stop.

18
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:38,110
(Leonard:)This was a stupid idea.

19
00:00:38,115 --> 00:00:40,315
(Leonard:)Negative reinforcement
isn't working.

20
00:00:40,317 --> 00:00:42,187
(Sheldon:)I think you mean
positive punishment.

21
00:00:42,185 --> 00:00:45,625
(Sheldon:)Negative reinforcement is the
removal of a positive stimulus.

22
00:00:45,622 --> 00:00:47,052
(Sheldon:)It's a common mistake.

23
00:00:47,057 --> 00:00:49,327
(Leonard:)Negative reinforcement
is really wrong?

24
00:00:49,326 --> 00:00:51,056
(Sheldon:)Oh, it's used incorrectly
all the time.

25
00:00:51,061 --> 00:00:52,861
(Sheldon:)Even Bill Murray
makes that mistake

26
00:00:52,863 --> 00:00:54,793
(Sheldon:)in the first scene
of Ghostbusters.

27
00:00:54,798 --> 00:00:58,498
(Raj:)No way. Not Bill Murray.

28
00:00:58,502 --> 00:01:00,972
(Bill Murray(on screen):)I'm studying the effect
of negative reinforcement

